        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s1-clarity-elsewhere",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "While Odysseus longed for home on Calypso’s island, his wife and son were waiting in Ithaca."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "By lamplight, Penelope drew a thread out of the cloth."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s1-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Every morning, she wove. Every night, she quietly undid a little of her work."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s1-clarity-suitors",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Men called suitors wanted to marry Penelope and take Odysseus’s place. They ate the family’s food while they waited."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s1-p3",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Penelope promised to choose a new husband when she finished a cloth for Laertes, Odysseus’s elderly father."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s1-p4",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "The men who wanted her hand believed they were waiting for a piece of work."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s1-p5",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "By undoing her weaving each night, she kept the cloth unfinished. This gave her more time to wait for Odysseus."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s1-draw-back-another-row",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 1800,
          "effects": {
            "cloth": 0.42,
            "unpick": 2,
            "actors": {
              "penelope": {
                "pose": "sit",
                "facing": "right",
                "seated": 1
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s1-p6",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Another row loosened. Another small part of the morning came away."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s1-p7",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "She could not bring Odysseus home by pulling a thread."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s1-p8",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "But she could keep his place from being given away before morning."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s1-p9",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Another day. Tonight, that was what she could make."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s1-leave-the-moment",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 550,
