        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s3-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "The next morning, Telemachus went to a meeting of Ithaca’s people near the harbor. He asked them for help."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s3-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "telemachus",
          "text": "“Men are eating through my house while they ask to marry my mother.”",
          "listener": "elder"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s3-p3",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "elder",
          "text": "“And what do you ask of us?”",
          "listener": "telemachus"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s3-p4",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "telemachus",
          "text": "“A ship. And the chance to learn whether my father is alive.”",
          "listener": "elder"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s3-p5",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "The elder looked at him for a long moment. No promise followed."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s3-turn-toward-the-harbor",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 1800,
          "effects": {
            "view": "harbor",
            "boat": {
              "visible": 1
            },
            "actors": {
              "elder": {
                "visible": 1
              },
              "athena": {
                "visible": 1
              },
              "telemachus": {
                "x": 920,
                "y": 865,
                "pose": "walk",
                "facing": "right"
              }
            }
          },
          "transition": {
            "kind": "shot",
            "durationMs": 700,
            "reason": "From the assembly to the prepared boat"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s3-clarity-plan",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "The meeting ended without help. Telemachus went down to the pier, where Athena had arranged a boat and companions."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s3-p6",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "At the harbor, the traveler was waiting beside a prepared boat."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s3-p7",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Athena had found the help that the assembly had not offered."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s3-walk-down-the-pier",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 2500,
          "effects": {
            "actors": {
              "telemachus": {
                "x": 860,
