        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s4-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "After reaching Sparta, Telemachus came to King Menelaus’s palace. Menelaus had fought beside Odysseus at Troy."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s4-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Telemachus had traveled here to ask for news. This time, his host knew something about where Odysseus was."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s4-p3",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "menelaus",
          "text": "“Your father found a way when the rest of us could not see one.”",
          "listener": "telemachus"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s4-lift-the-cup",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 950,
          "effects": {
            "cup": {
              "x": 691,
              "y": 817,
              "held": 1
            },
            "actors": {
              "telemachus": {
                "pose": "reach"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s4-p4",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "Telemachus lifted his cup, then held it without drinking."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s4-p5",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "telemachus",
          "text": "“Did you hear what became of him?”",
          "listener": "menelaus"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s4-p6",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "who": "menelaus",
          "text": "“I heard he was alive. Held on an island, with no ship to carry him away.”",
          "listener": "telemachus"
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s4-lower-the-cup",
          "type": "action",
          "duration": 1100,
          "effects": {
            "cup": {
              "x": 735,
              "y": 800,
              "held": 0
            },
            "actors": {
              "telemachus": {
                "pose": "reach"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s4-p7",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "He set the cup down carefully. Alive."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s4-p8",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "It was not the same as home. It was not a promise that the sea would be kind."
        },
        {
          "id": "odyssey-c2-s4-p9",
          "type": "text",
          "kind": "narration",
          "who": null,
          "text": "But it was a word he could carry back to his mother."
        },
